{"title": "Will Galaxy S27 Ultra and Pixel 12 mark the end of the flagship era of smartphones?", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/galaxy-s27-ultra-pixel-12-end-flagship-era/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/S26-Ultra-Pixel-11-Pro-and-iPhone-17-Pro.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Like most Android fans, you probably enjoy having the latest and greatest smartphone buried in your pocket. The best camera, the best display, the fastest processor, and of course, as much RAM as any given smartphone OEM will pack in. And even as we’ve watched the typical flagship price balloon into the four-digit space, trade-in offers, carrier deals, and steep sales on certain hardware brands like Pixel have made it all too easy to keep up on what’s new in gadgets without breaking the bank year-in and year-out.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/galaxy-s27-ultra-pixel-12-end-flagship-era/#more-735233\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-10-30T07:30:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-02T20:09:31.608480+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Pixel 6 postmortem: How Google’s flawed reboot defined future hardware [Video]", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/pixel-6-postmortem/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2022/11/Google-Pixel-6.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I think there are few smartphones in the past decade that have arrived carrying the sheer weight of expectation that greeted the Pixel 6 and Pixel 6 Pro in late 2021. <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/20/pixel-6-no-android-17-qpr2/\">Now on life support</a>, just what did we learn from 2021’s reboot for the brand?</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/pixel-6-postmortem/#more-734856\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-10-30T07:05:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-02T20:09:31.608480+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
